WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.420
Every day, NASA paints the whole planet.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.920
But millions of people will never see those paintings.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.380
So Terra Tunes plays them.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Warmer seas sing higher: you can hear where the ocean runs hot.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.300
Every note comes from a real NASA measurement,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.140
and the Data Deck shows you which one.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.180
Got a NASA picture of your own? Scan it, and it sings too.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.360
Terra Tunes. Now everyone can hear the Earth.
